has the physical examination report come out?

302
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,039
I want to know

303
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:13,559
the current situation

304
00:16:13,879 --> 00:16:15,159
of my heart disease.

305
00:16:16,559 --> 00:16:17,120
Is it still possible

306
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:18,360
for me to play basketball?

307
00:16:18,559 --> 00:16:19,799
Heart disease?

308
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,320
Okay, I see.

309
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:33,080
I'll keep that in mind.

310
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,360
Did you hear all that?

311
00:16:58,320 --> 00:16:59,279
Don't tell Zhou Yang.

312
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,399
Don't tell anyone.

313
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:04,240
I swear to God,

314
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:05,279
I won't tell anyone.

315
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:09,279
So,

316
00:17:09,799 --> 00:17:11,359
