317
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:13,319
because you look down on us,

318
00:17:14,079 --> 00:17:15,480
but because of your health.

319
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:21,880
Why are you laughing?

320
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:23,319
Nothing.

321
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:24,599
Although it may be

322
00:17:24,599 --> 00:17:26,079
a little unkind,

323
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:27,839
I'm still very happy.

324
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:29,640
Do you actually

325
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:30,920
want to join us very much?

326
00:17:34,839 --> 00:17:36,240
Slow down.

327
00:17:39,319 --> 00:17:40,000
Coach

328
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:40,880
I'm back.

329
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:41,440
Welcome.

330
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:44,000
Welcome.

331
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,039
Welcome.

332
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:48,640
You can't do this again.

333
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:49,920
If you don't feel well,

334
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:51,240
you can't just push through.

335
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:52,079
Your body

336
00:17:52,079 --> 00:17:53,119
doesn't just belong to you,

337
00:17:53,119 --> 00:17:54,319
it also belongs to the team.

338
00:17:54,319 --> 00:17:54,920
Got it?

339
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:55,799
Yes, sir.

340
00:17:56,279 --> 00:17:57,640
I won't do it again.

341
00:17:58,160 --> 00:17:58,680
Sit down.

342
00:18:00,319 --> 00:18:01,200
Now,

343
00:18:02,119 --> 00:18:03,119
let's get down to business.

344
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:06,119
The group stage

345
00:18:06,119 --> 00:18:07,240
consists of six games.

346
00:18:07,519 --> 00:18:08,920
We've played three.

347
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:10,960
Yibei

348
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:12,119
has one win and two losses,

349
00:18:12,119 --> 00:18:13,000
putting us at the bottom of the standings.

350
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:21,480
But there's still a chance.

351
00:18:22,559 --> 00:18:23,920
So, the next game

352
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:25,440
against the Middle School Affiliated to the Institute of Physical Education,

353
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:26,480
we must win.

354
00:18:29,039 --> 00:18:30,000
You know,

355
00:18:30,559 --> 00:18:32,519
The Sports Institute's Middle School is a top team.

356
00:18:33,079 --> 00:18:34,640
With your previous

357
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:36,359
scattered and uncoordinated style of play,

358
00:18:36,359 --> 00:18:37,359
you definitely can't win.

359
00:18:37,839 --> 00:18:39,720
So you have to master

360
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:41,279
the tactical system I've set up.

361
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:42,680
Do you understand?

362
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:43,920
Yes, sir.

363
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:45,880
I have another piece of news.

364
00:18:46,279 --> 00:18:47,279
The Middle School Affiliated to the Institute of Physical Education

365
00:18:47,279 --> 00:18:49,160
has a new player this year.

366
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,279
He is very strong.

367
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:51,960
He may become

368
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:53,960
a big obstacle to your victory.

369
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:55,839
Who is he?

370
00:18:55,920 --> 00:18:57,519
I don't know.

371
00:18:57,519 --> 00:18:58,839
The Middle School Affiliated to the Institute of Physical Education

372
00:18:58,839 --> 00:19:00,440
is good at teamwork.

373
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:01,319
Now,

374
00:19:01,319 --> 00:19:02,759
they have an ace up their sleeve.

375
00:19:03,599 --> 00:19:05,000
It's even harder to beat them.

376
00:19:05,359 --> 00:19:06,480
Oh my god.

377
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:08,880
It's like a mission impossible.

378
00:19:09,359 --> 00:19:10,480
What kind of player?

379
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:10,839
What's his name?

380
00:19:10,839 --> 00:19:11,720
What does he look like?

381
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,200
His name is Xie Yizhou.

382
00:19:14,279 --> 00:19:15,119
He has never

383
00:19:15,119 --> 00:19:16,559
played a single public game.

384
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:18,039
But he has a nickname,

385
00:19:18,799 --> 00:19:19,720
Stats Monster.

386
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:20,720
What?

387
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:21,440
Stats Monster.

388
00:19:22,119 --> 00:19:22,920
What does it mean?

389
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:23,799
It means that

390
00:19:23,799 --> 00:19:25,240
his data in all aspects of technology

391
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,440
are insanely high.

392
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:28,920
Just like cheating in games.

393
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,519
He is a basketball genius.

394
00:19:31,119 --> 00:19:32,599
A genius.

395
00:19:33,079 --> 00:19:33,839
Did you hear that?

396
00:19:34,519 --> 00:19:35,480
So,

397
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:36,519
next,

398
00:19:36,519 --> 00:19:37,519
you all need to

399
00:19:37,519 --> 00:19:38,680
follow my guidance

400
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,880
and carry it out to the end.

401
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:41,759
Because only a genius

402
00:19:41,759 --> 00:19:43,400
can defeat a genius.

403
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:48,200
Coach,

404
00:19:48,559 --> 00:19:49,799
