433
00:20:55,240 --> 00:20:56,559
This is called on-the-ground research,

434
00:20:56,559 --> 00:20:57,599
understand?

435
00:20:57,599 --> 00:20:59,440
Got it, totally.

436
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,880
Sounds super exciting.

437
00:21:01,839 --> 00:21:03,640
What if we get caught?

438
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:04,599
Don't worry,

439
00:21:04,599 --> 00:21:05,799
I'm all set.

440
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:09,400
Where did you get the uniforms?

441
00:21:09,759 --> 00:21:10,960
Getting a few uniforms

442
00:21:10,960 --> 00:21:12,200
is a piece of cake for me.

443
00:21:12,319 --> 00:21:13,799
That's so you, Connections Guy.

444
00:21:13,799 --> 00:21:14,839
Impressive.

445
00:21:15,559 --> 00:21:16,079
Let's go.

446
00:21:16,079 --> 00:21:17,279
Let's find a place to change clothes first,

447
00:21:17,279 --> 00:21:18,279
then we can go in.

448
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:22,640
What's up?

449
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:28,680
Gu Chenyang,

450
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:29,680
are you scared?

451
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:31,160
If you don't go in,

452
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:32,440
the training will be over soon.

453
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:34,480
Reverse psychology doesn't work on me.

454
00:21:36,759 --> 00:21:37,759
Fine.

455
00:21:37,759 --> 00:21:39,279
Then if we lose the next game,

456
00:21:39,279 --> 00:21:40,799
the basketball club will be disbanded,

457
00:21:41,119 --> 00:21:42,279
Then I can go back

458
00:21:42,279 --> 00:21:43,640
and continue my band.

459
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:47,680
Let's make a deal.

460
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:49,359
Don't run around when you get in.

461
00:21:49,880 --> 00:21:51,039
Just watch quietly for a while and leave.

462
00:21:52,559 --> 00:21:53,400
No problem.

463
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:56,599
Okay.

464
00:21:56,599 --> 00:21:57,319
Just this time.

465
00:21:57,759 --> 00:21:58,519
Let's go.

466
00:22:03,559 --> 00:22:04,440
Nice.

467
00:22:05,559 --> 00:22:06,079
Backboard!

468
00:22:06,079 --> 00:22:06,640
Behind you!

469
00:22:07,440 --> 00:22:07,880
Good!

470
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:10,400
Defense, defense!

471
00:22:15,799 --> 00:22:16,200
Go!

472
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:16,880
Just sit here.

473
00:22:16,880 --> 00:22:17,680
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

474
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:29,119
Be careful.

475
00:22:29,519 --> 00:22:30,200
It's okay.

476
00:22:35,240 --> 00:22:36,480
Look at that tall guy.

477
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:38,039
My source said

478
00:22:38,319 --> 00:22:38,839
he seems to be

479
00:22:38,839 --> 00:22:40,079
the newcomer a few days ago.

480
00:22:40,079 --> 00:22:41,279
He should be Xie Yizhou.

481
00:22:41,559 --> 00:22:42,359
Oh my god.

482
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:43,519
He's so strong.

483
00:22:44,039 --> 00:22:44,559
If I was bumped by him,

484
00:22:44,559 --> 00:22:45,880
I would fly away.

485
00:22:46,599 --> 00:22:47,039
Oh my god.

486
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:50,039
Something is wrong.

487
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:51,640
This person

488
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:53,119
is outstanding in physical conditions,

489
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,799
he is not flexible enough.

490
00:22:55,160 --> 00:22:56,720
And he lacks communication with his teammates.

491
00:22:57,519 --> 00:22:59,279
The Middle School Affiliated to the Institute of Physical Education always emphasizes

492
00:22:59,279 --> 00:23:00,519
