493
00:23:01,039 --> 00:23:02,640
The main players should not be like this.

494
00:23:02,640 --> 00:23:03,559
What should we do?

495
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:06,240
How about we ask someone?

496
00:23:07,359 --> 00:23:08,079
Who?

497
00:23:10,480 --> 00:23:12,519
Why does that person's back look so...

498
00:23:15,279 --> 00:23:16,200
You guys,

499
00:23:16,200 --> 00:23:17,759
What are you doing taking pictures with your phone?

500
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:19,640
What are you doing sneaking around here?

501
00:23:19,640 --> 00:23:20,400
Which class are you from?

502
00:23:21,039 --> 00:23:22,039
We are...

503
00:23:22,039 --> 00:23:22,519
Don't say that.

504
00:23:22,519 --> 00:23:23,640
Go, run.

505
00:23:23,720 --> 00:23:24,160
Quick, go.

506
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:24,680
Go see what's going on.

507
00:23:24,680 --> 00:23:25,440
Stop.

508
00:23:28,039 --> 00:23:28,759
Don't run.

509
00:23:30,119 --> 00:23:31,160
Stop!

510
00:23:32,119 --> 00:23:32,640
Stop!

511
00:23:32,640 --> 00:23:33,319
Stop!

512
00:23:33,319 --> 00:23:34,359
You fools!

513
00:23:39,359 --> 00:23:40,279
Stop!

514
00:23:41,519 --> 00:23:42,039
Oh no!

515
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:43,400
Come in!

516
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:44,880
Hurry up!

517
00:23:51,519 --> 00:23:52,160
Where are they?

518
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:52,759
They're not here.

519
00:23:53,160 --> 00:23:54,000
No?

520
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:56,079
Let's check over there.

521
00:23:56,079 --> 00:23:56,759
Go.

522
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:02,440
