527
00:24:20,240 --> 00:24:21,319
Probably from the Yibei team.

528
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:27,559
They look serious.

529
00:24:29,200 --> 00:24:30,079
Who are you?

530
00:24:32,599 --> 00:24:33,680
From the basketball team?

531
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:36,799
