532
00:24:38,279 --> 00:24:39,400
Don't be nervous.

533
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:40,759
If I wanted to expose you,

534
00:24:41,039 --> 00:24:41,759
I wouldn't have helped you

535
00:24:41,759 --> 00:24:42,440
