538
00:24:51,680 --> 00:24:53,039
You really know him?

539
00:24:53,240 --> 00:24:54,640
We've lost twice in a row,

540
00:24:54,880 --> 00:24:56,039
but we still have fans.

541
00:24:56,880 --> 00:24:59,119
The results don't represent our strength.

542
00:24:59,759 --> 00:25:00,960
Li Haoyu

543
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:02,960
