546
00:25:10,759 --> 00:25:11,960
You practice every day, right?

547
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:14,039
Thanks to Gu Chenyang

548
00:25:14,039 --> 00:25:15,079
for designing it for me.

549
00:25:16,519 --> 00:25:18,759
You just called us seniors.

550
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:20,240
Are you a middle school student?

551
00:25:22,359 --> 00:25:23,640
Yeah, I'm in the 9th grade,

552
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:24,799
at the middle school here.

553
00:25:26,039 --> 00:25:27,559
Have you heard of

554
00:25:27,559 --> 00:25:29,599
the basketball team's prodigy?

555
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:33,440
We came here specially to...

556
00:25:33,440 --> 00:25:34,480
It's getting late.

557
00:25:34,480 --> 00:25:35,839
Thank you for your help.

558
00:25:36,160 --> 00:25:37,599
We have to go now.

559
00:25:37,599 --> 00:25:38,480
You're leaving already?

560
00:25:38,880 --> 00:25:40,319
I can show you around.

561
00:25:41,039 --> 00:25:41,759
No need.

562
00:25:42,079 --> 00:25:43,079
We have other things to do.

563
00:25:43,839 --> 00:25:44,359
Let's go.

564
00:25:45,079 --> 00:25:45,799
Goodbye.

565
00:25:46,720 --> 00:25:47,799
Thank you.

566
00:25:48,039 --> 00:25:49,000
Thank you.

567
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:50,160
See you next time. Bye.

568
00:25:50,160 --> 00:25:50,960
Goodbye.
